[SIZE=4][COLOR=#6600CC]🎯 Anti-Farming System[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]New Cooldown Features:[/B][/COLOR]
Prevents players from farming bosses and graves for rewards:

[CODE]
# Configurable per-player cooldowns
pumpkin_zombie_boss:
  cooldown_minutes: 10    # 10min between zombie boss spawns

pumpkin_skeleton_boss:  
  cooldown_minutes: 10    # 10min between skeleton boss spawns

grave:
  cooldown_minutes: 15    # 15min between grave activations
[/CODE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]Grave Reward Protection:[/B][/COLOR]
Players must kill at least 50% of grave mobs to receive full rewards. Incomplete graves give reduced loot (1 dirt + 1 pumpkin).

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600]� Installation & Migration[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace with [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.5.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start server → Config auto-migrates with backup
[*]All player data and progress preserved
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#CC6600][B]From v3.0.1-v3.0.4:[/B][/COLOR] Config replaced with v3.0.5 defaults, backup created as [FONT=courier]config.old_TIMESTAMP.yml[/FONT]
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Messages.yml:[/B][/COLOR] All customizations preserved automatically

